                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "92258b00-7363-4045-b4b1-aa71486c0a92",
                                "sense_id": "2f5150d8-15ad-386b-9a82-9df9b2016c9f",
                                "text": "It seemed less awkward then stripping her the right way, as he didn't care to see her bits, and though he couldn't help but see a few things while slipping her into a long shirt, he felt like he did rather well considering[…]"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "4c61d275-7714-42b6-b502-7ac6c2e2501b",
                                "sense_id": "2f5150d8-15ad-386b-9a82-9df9b2016c9f",
                                "text": "Orange Dog\nThe orange dog licks your face\n Showing that she loves you\n Right after she licked her bits\n Giving them a good clean\n But her wagging tail and smile\n Are enuff[…]"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "034f9a37-6141-4b71-8a19-f391c353e077",
                                "sense_id": "2f5150d8-15ad-386b-9a82-9df9b2016c9f",
                                "text": "“The accent really took over when I started watching the show,” she said. “It blew the accent the fuck up, and everyone was obsessed with their cute little sayings, like ‘doing bits’.” (For the uninitiated, that means getting intimate but not having sex.)"
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "09c1dbb2-ca40-3e26-b4a1-98be1938e704",
                        "entry_id": "c5c786be-f8f3-302a-8fe0-3c31f5009f03",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Neighbourhood; hood; manor; ends."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "Multicultural-London-English",
                            "plural",
                            "plural-only"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "5164a4fb-7c1b-41c4-9436-fbb4fa83200d",
                                "sense_id": "09c1dbb2-ca40-3e26-b4a1-98be1938e704",
                                "text": "You think you’re real now you’ve got a couple sticks? My favourite younger, he got stabbed in my bits. And if he died fam, I promise I’d have quit."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "7520ce24-931a-44d9-b9dd-b63d1ef665ea",
                                "sense_id": "09c1dbb2-ca40-3e26-b4a1-98be1938e704",
                                "text": "I told the youts in my bits. Don’t ever lose if I win."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "d3bf88ca-2e17-4a3a-9f63-2c5b423dd7ac",
                                "sense_id": "09c1dbb2-ca40-3e26-b4a1-98be1938e704",
                                "text": "PRESIDENT T: I don’t wanna talk no crud in bars. Maybe ‘cuz, in my bits, I’m actually someone."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "34981ab2-52e4-4209-ae57-ef60ef2eff81",
                                "sense_id": "09c1dbb2-ca40-3e26-b4a1-98be1938e704",
                                "text": "JAEKAE: Free all my G’s, they got locked for licks. Five minutes of fame and I’m hittin’ for six. Past seven, eight, nine, and you’re in my bits."
                            }
                        ]
